1795199391787930	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-1c6	{"field":"description","value":"At b9a0455 ruleset::verify_loaded receives JSON and an allow-rule count. The existing empty-load regression tests a missing installation. A rule count and chain policies cannot establish that the installed addresses, ports, protocols, verdicts, and accounting behavior match the approved policy.\n\nImplement a pure comparator over typed expected policy and the narrow nft JSON vocabulary emitted by playpen. Compare table family, chain hooks and priorities, rule order, matches, verdicts and terminal accounting. Ignore volatile handles and counter values. Use recorded supported nft readbacks as fixtures, including equivalent spellings. Require acceptance of a matching policy and refusal of a same-length fixture with a narrower port interval or unknown material expression. Document fixture provenance and the supported expression set. Production wiring and live namespace evidence belong to bn-yly. Reference: https://www.netfilter.org/projects/nftables/manpage.html"}	blake3:dYEu-DyVvuB2olg03CeOhaV_QabLAotJagqKO7S9tr0
