1795199392572016	codex	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-29o	{"field":"description","value":"Trial 2026-11-19 with a container on the host network inside playpen. Three blockers: (1) newuidmap is refused under no_new_privs, so Podman only starts with /etc/subuid and /etc/subgid hidden (single-uid mapping) and a separate image store; (2) Landlock refuses the mounts Podman and crun make, so it needs --without-landlock, which gives up the host-socket protection; (3) packet sockets are denied, so tcpdump inside the container cannot capture. With 1 and 2 worked around, unapproved sends were dropped and reported. \n\nUse this existing compatibility evidence to explain in the requirements or design notes which guarantees the supported default provides and why the observed nested setup is outside it. Check a normal guarded offline invocation still works on the qualifying host. Record evidence and version limits of any support claim. New container modes or packet capture are separate design decisions."}	blake3:2z4vZgTz0SJ4onXKiHyF12lfGvPAZyRc1rRtsl--FSk
