1795393195321096	lead	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1w3	{"body":"Interactive single delivery is available with --private-tty and foreground terminal stdin dedicated to Playpen. Native PTY tests saw eight receipts from eight paced sends split evenly between supervisor PID and outer group. Nested Bash pipelines, an outer cat, per-job fg/bg, a foreground group whose leader has exited, whole-sandbox freeze, resize, output drain and cleanup on supervisor SIGKILL were exercised. Final host validation passed 186 selected tests and all 12 qualification scenarios. The compatibility default still shares the caller terminal and a group signal can reach the workload twice. Keep this bone open for the original shared-terminal requirement."}	blake3:GCfvcUmtBT1ckVifjYUxy7Wc1D0nb-bQZigBOd2uGFI
