1795395500448083	lead	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1w3	{"body":"Checked 042afd4 with a session-leader supervisor and a pre-existing stage reading the keyboard with SIGTTIN blocked. The stage read its line; four paced group sends produced eight workload receipts. All 128 signalfd bytes matched at each of three recipients for a group send versus sending to the same processes individually. Moving the workload to its own foreground group gave single delivery but the host reader got EIO. Idle and waiting private PTY readers produced identical master readiness. The unmerged acceptance regression is commit 60d7761, where detached PID/group and attached PID pass before the attached group case fails. Explicit private mode now preserves redirected stdin with a separate /dev/tty keyboard, including when stdout and stderr are redirected; eight alternating PID/group sends produced eight receipts. The true shared foreground case remains open."}	blake3:YaDa283hffQBZ7bNlCrBSjY443RRRrPFzhoiaC7MvAE
